<title>USA: Granite exchanges prfd shrs for prfd shrs.</title>
<headline>Granite exchanges prfd shrs for prfd shrs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Granite Broadcasting Corp said Friday that it is offering $153,241,000 principal amount of its 12-3/4 percent Cumulative Exchangeable Preferred Stock due April 1, 2009 in exchange for $153,241,000 principal amount of its 12-3/4 percent Cumulative Exchangeable Preferred Stock due April 1, 2009.</p>
<p>The company, which operations 11 television stations, said the offer expires July 28, unless extended.</p>
</text>
